      'index.card.stage.p':'Grand opening ceremony with the Consul General of India, classical Kathak and Bharatanatyam dance, Bollywood medley, and live Sitar & fusion music.',
      'index.card.food.tag':'Culinary Experience',
      'index.card.food.p':"Street-food style regional stalls spanning North, South, East, and West Indian cuisines, with a Masala Chai corner and traditional Indian sweets.",
      'index.btn.stalls':'Explore Stalls','index.btn.experience':'View Experience',
      'index.visual.eyebrow':'Visual Language','index.visual.h2':'Minimal.<br>Rich.<br>Editorial.',
      'index.visual.p':"The site now uses a restrained black, cream, muted earth, indigo, and metallic-accent palette. The mood is closer to a luxury exhibition, fashion installation, and cultural museum than an event-led spectacle.",
      'index.visit.h2':'Plan Your Visit',
      'index.visit.lead':'Two days in Milan dedicated to craft, material memory, and contemporary Indian cultural perception.',
      'index.btn.visit':'Visit Details','index.btn.contact':'Contact Us',
      'index.marquee.1':'Craftsmanship','index.marquee.2':'Material Culture','index.marquee.3':'Indian Design',
      'index.marquee.4':'Sensory Memory','index.marquee.5':'Participatory Experiences',
