      'stalls.card.jewellery.tag':'Jewellery','stalls.card.jewellery.h3':'Indian Jewellery',
      'stalls.card.jewellery.p':'A curated collection of traditional and contemporary jewellery — jhumkas, bangles, anklets, nose rings, and layered necklaces inspired by different regions of India.',
      'stalls.stage.eyebrow':'Live Programme','stalls.stage.h2':'Main<br>Stage',
      'stalls.stage.p1':'The centrepiece of the event. Opens with a formal ceremony featuring the Consul General of India and a Comune di Milano representative.',
      'stalls.stage.p2':'Followed by classical Kathak and Bharatanatyam dance, a professional Bollywood medley troupe, and a live Sitar & fusion music ensemble.',
      'stalls.stage.item1.h3':'Grand Opening Ceremony','stalls.stage.item1.p':'Consul General of India & Comune di Milano representative.',
      'stalls.stage.item2.h3':'Kathak & Bharatanatyam','stalls.stage.item2.p':'Classical Indian dance performances.',
      'stalls.stage.item3.h3':'Bollywood Medley Troupe','stalls.stage.item3.p':'Professional contemporary Bollywood performance.',
      'stalls.stage.item4.h3':'Sitar & Fusion Ensemble','stalls.stage.item4.p':'Live music performance.',
      'stalls.food.eyebrow':'Culinary Experience','stalls.food.h2':'Taste<br>of India',
      'stalls.food.p1':"A street-food style area with regional stalls covering North, South, East, and West Indian cuisines. A live dialogue between India's culinary heritage and Milan's food culture.",
      'stalls.food.p2':'Includes a Masala Chai corner and traditional Indian sweets. All operators hold valid food permits, and eco-friendly packaging is required throughout.',
      'stalls.womb.eyebrow':'Immersive Installation','stalls.womb.h2':'The Womb<br>of OM',
      'stalls.womb.p1':'"OM" is treated as the form of the universe — a continuous cycle of creation, existence, and return.',
      'stalls.womb.p2':'Inspired by ancient temple carvings where life is shown emerging within sacred sound forms, the installation reflects the idea of origin held inside the symbol itself.',
      'stalls.womb.p3':'The umbilical cord becomes the visual thread of life, connecting beginning and becoming in one unbroken flow.',
      'stalls.womb.p4':'The stall translates this into an immersive experience where the body moves through cycles of birth, growth, and return.',
      // VISIT
